{"rootPinId":"26bc504c946c798b47ef090d4c3b7f629917c0fc3a51740ce1252db586692181i0","title":"metaTask 战役 · JSP-000870 Erdős 级数 Σ1/(2^n−3) 无理性的 Lean 形式化","brief":"Borwein 1991 自包含证明的 bounded-size Lean 形式化：引理阶梯（收敛与部分和结构、分母递推与2-进赋值界、尾部估计、无理性判据）→ lake build 机判。形式化陈述以独立 correspondence 件为准（级数起点 n≥2 与『无理性』范围必须先对照 [Bo91] 确认）。战役首个真正的形式化节点。","publisher":"idq14hmv23j5fnlx4ccnmvlyldjd38xjsechzwg9xz","tags":["metatask","wave-1","JSP-000870","lean"],"treeid":"4ed895a8d675ceef2f41c3831686dab50d478f4869e23534521e243ac19380e3i0","specid":"5a4c2e6057444afcdd83aaaec0c19782c97e8d8e9d87fb53b483c326e8c79151i0","spec":{"name":"lean-build","lang":"bash","entry":"spec-lean-build.sh","scriptOrScriptPin":"#!/usr/bin/env bash\n# spec-lean-build.sh — 通用 Lean 形式化验证器（MetaTask spec 脚本，协议 v1.2.1 §spec 契约）\n#\n# 输入（stdin，JSON）: { \"repo\": \"pin://|metafile://|本地路径\", \"target\": \"相对于 repo 根的 .lean 文件\" }\n# 输出（stdout，JSON）: { \"verdict\": \"pass\" | \"fail\" | \"invalid\", \"detail\": \"...\" }\n# 判据: 在仓库根执行 lake build <target>，退出码 0 = pass（全部定理无 sorry 报错即视为\n#       编译判定；--warning-as-error=error 保证 sorry/lint 失败即失败）。\n# null/缺失 → invalid 并注明位置（协议 null_tolerance 判据）。\n# 离线性: 输入为 pin://|metafile:// 时先经 metaid 内容端点拉取（发射环境自带工具）；\n#         拉取失败 → invalid，不悬挂。\nset -euo pipefail\n\ninput=\"$(cat)\"\n\nrepo=\"$(printf '%s' \"$input\" | python3 -c 'import json,sys; d=sys.stdin.read(); print(json.loads(d).get(\"repo\") or \"\")' 2>/dev/null || true)\"\ntarget=\"$(printf '%s' \"$input\" | python3 -c 'import json,sys; d=sys.stdin.read(); print(json.loads(d).get(\"target\") or \"\")' 2>/dev/null || true)\"\n\ninvalid() { printf '{\"verdict\":\"invalid\",\"detail\":\"%s\"}\\n' \"$1\"; exit 0; }\n[ -n \"$repo\" ] || invalid \"missing field: repo\"\n[ -n \"$target\" ] || invalid \"missing field: target\"\n\nworkdir=\"$repo\"\ncase \"$repo\" in\n  pin://*|metafile://*)\n    tmp=\"$(mktemp -d)\"\n    if ! fetch_output=\"$(metabot \"$repo\" --download \"$tmp\" 2>&1)\"; then\n      invalid \"artifact fetch failed: $fetch_output\"\n    fi\n    workdir=\"$tmp\"\n    ;;\nesac\n\n[ -f \"$workdir/lakefile.lean\" ] || [ -f \"$workdir/lakefile.toml\" ] || invalid \"not a lake project root: $workdir\"\n\nif (cd \"$workdir\" && lake build \"$target\" --warning-as-error=error >/dev/null 2>&1); then\n  printf '{\"verdict\":\"pass\",\"detail\":\"lake build %s clean\"}\\n' \"$target\"\nelse\n  printf '{\"verdict\":\"fail\",\"detail\":\"lake build %s failed (or contains sorry/admitted)\"}\\n' \"$target\"\nfi\n","input":"","output":""},"policy":{"challenge_ttl_days":14,"claim_ttl_hours":48,"reward_sat":0,"split":{"rosterid":"796fee0826c3f3400cfe5c21387e0d9b0970a6311b32ec9361bf5170e12ec27fi0","submitterShareBP":8000},"verify_quorum":2,"verify_window_hours":96},"nodes":[{"id":"crit","parent":"root","title":"无理性判据（整数比下界）整合定理","kind":"formalize","params":{"target":"Erdos870/Irrationality.lean"},"specid":null,"deps":[],"weight":1700,"machineState":"verified","displayState":"verified","cycleOutcome":"none","cycleSeq":2,"disputed":false,"currentClaim":{"claimPinId":"4f28bffe3e577fb1a37671540260b0912c704739339022367a62c77af31b16e7i0","claimant":"idq14nyxgcqx6f26zpn68xmvrg0xe87fdevl0n4t5k","blockHeight":192591,"blockTs":1791308924,"ttlDeadlineTs":1791481724},"activeSubmission":{"submissionPinId":"94b25a42179677a729802410fe458649bd9962ba012e65432df4efe4bb8050cei0","submitter":"idq14nyxgcqx6f26zpn68xmvrg0xe87fdevl0n4t5k","blockHeight":192591,"blockTs":1791308924,"hash":"fea351fa9790bbf63dd370bb9c8af59e36bd4243f36ade4dea60015393b3abb9","contentType":"application/json;utf-8","attachment":"metafile://02b902934ec089d55ef57ff08054c6158e3f32276d26a86df9063bd83a2944e0i0","childids":[],"result":{"artifactSha256":"a48a095eb12929b05d831f3257d4e6282ab6b7ba26e1161add448fa0a4f28b68","hash":"d17427f518efb1977a9c1fdfa9a69b1c6078a9254db7d53ac61c7e9f0836adf0","note":"v4 deliverable for crit: the full unconditional chain of the integration theorem, Std-only Lean (no mathlib, toolchain leanprover/lean4:v4.34.1, warnings-as-errors). Repo wave1-lean contains: (1) criterion layer — ConvergesTo / NoRationalLimit / irrational_of_approx (Erdos870/Criterion.lean); (2) Borwein's explicit Pade-approximant construction — q-binomial and q-Lagrange identities, integer clearing (Pade/Integrality/Acorr/Numerator/NhIntegral, incl. unconditional numerator_integrality), super-exponential error estimate with the S<->z reduction zBPart_eq_S (ErrorEst §1–§4l), sign layer and crossing-witness conversion (Sign/Witness §5a–§5c, incl. crossing_witness_from_construction); (3) integration entry Erdos870/Irrationality.lean — unconditional S_irrational : NoRationalLimit (criterion instantiation, shift n->n+1 around Bden 0 = 0), plus section bridge (Sliteral = -1 + S; Sliteral_noRationalLimit) covering both the n>=2 tail (correspondence statement) and the n>=1 literal reading (erdosproblems.com / [Bo91]). All statements proved: zero sorry, zero custom axioms; #print axioms subset of [propext, Classical.choice, Quot.sound]; lake build Erdos870/Irrationality.lean (19 jobs) and full lake build (24 jobs) green, incl. a zero-cache clean-room rebuild; locally double-reviewed (independent numeric recomputation + code review). Statement alignment vs correspondence-T3-JSP-000870 (metafile://028e1432d1059070fc76ceed018c45429d1263ba5c2f0ad1c5e6e69c8dfb01ci0): index base n>=2 confirmed against [Bo91]; scope = irrationality, not transcendence. Reviewer note: `lake build <target> --warning-as-error=error` fails on Lean v4.34.1 (unknown long option) before any build judgement; equivalent criterion = project-level warningAsError=true + plain `lake build <target>` (see README '给复核者的提示'). Artifact zip sha256 a48a095eb12929b05d831f3257d4e6282ab6b7ba26e1161add448fa0a4f28b68.","repo":"metafile://02b902934ec089d55ef57ff08054c6158e3f32276d26a86df9063bd83a2944e0i0.zip","target":"Erdos870/Irrationality.lean"}},"verifiedAtBlockTs":1791513826,"votes":[{"verifyPinId":"cf01328f25c0c50680db8be377ed5f326233916dae25ab0c6dea459782ee5b3bi0","v