items":[{"assessment":"aligned","evidence":"re-fetch 2026-09-30 https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TheJustinSunPrize/awards/main/problems/catalog-0801-0900.md 段 JSP-000870；四条 verbatim 引用脚本比对 byte-equal","id":"statement","note":"题库 JSP-000870 的题面是问句「Is the series of reciprocals of powers of two minus three irrational?」，状态 Solved、Lean proof: No。artifact 的 formalizedStatement 把「2 的幂减 3 的倒数级数」钉成 sum_{n>=2} 1/(2^n - 3) 的无理性，并明说「级数起点是形式陈述的一部分」。关键核点：题面本身不给起点，而 n=1 时 2^1 - 3 = -1，n>=1 的读法会把 -1 这一项算进去；artifact 取 n>=2，并把这一点列为头号 divergence risk（须先对照 [Bo91] 确认）——即它把题面歧义显式披露而非掩盖。我 2026-09-30 重取题库原文（catalog-0801-0900.md 的 JSP-000870 段），artifact 携带的四条逐字引用（题面、Current status、Lean proof、Publication details）逐字节一致，故本条所对照的是题库自身文本而非转述。"},{"assessment":"aligned","evidence":"算术复算：2^1-3=-1, 2^2-3=1（起点决定级数是否含 -1 项）","id":"definitions","note":"三条定义各自把题面用语钉到形式化读法。第一条把「the series of reciprocals of powers of two minus three」钉成 sum_{n>=2} 1/(2^n - 3)，并指出 n>=1 时首项分母为 -1、故起点必须显式固定；第二条把 irrational 限定为「非有理数」，明说不许悄悄加强为超越性；第三条把级数收敛性标为形式化的证明义务而非任务的额外断言。三条与题库原句及所引 [Er48]（题源）/ [Er88c]（综述）/ [Bo91]（证明）的口径一致。我独立复算确认起点问题的实质：2^1 - 3 = -1 是真实的分母奇点（非零），而 n>=2 起首项 2^2 - 3 = 1，故起点读法确实负载语义而非记账细节。"},{"assessment":"aligned","evidence":"任务树 params 逐节点对照：lem1=Convergence, lem2=DenominatorRecurrence, lem3=TailEstimate, crit=Irrationality, build=lake build Irrationality.lean","id":"proof-direction","note":"题库记录 Solved，且明记 Lean proof: No；题源 [Er48]、综述 [Er88c]、证明 [Bo91]（J. Number Theory (1991), 253-259）。artifact 的 proofDirection 读法为「Lambert 型 / 分母递推的引理阶梯（收敛与部分和结构、分母递推与 2-进赋值界、尾部估计、整数比下界）→ lake build」，并明说复核须对照 [Bo91] 而非题面一行。该方向与任务树的 lem1/lem2/lem3/crit/build 节点阶梯逐一对应，且未声称本命题已有形式化（与 Lean proof: No 相符），也未把范围扩到一般族或超越性。"}],"method":{"bankRecord":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/TheJustinSunPrize/awards/main/problems/catalog-0801-0900.md#JSP-000870","evidenceType":"primary-source re-fetch + arithmetic recomputation","fetchedAt":"2026-09-30","referenceChecked":"[Bo91] On the irrationality of sum(1/(q^n+r)), J. Number Theory (1991), 253-259 — cited by the record; full text NOT consulted (paywall)"},"node":"review","observations":["我核不了的格子（本件最大未核格）proposition 之外的对照：[Bo91] 原文（J. Number Theory 1991, 253-259）为付费墙，我未能取得全文，故「引理阶梯是否逐步忠于 Borwein 1991」这一格我核不了；我核到的是 artifact 自述、题库引用与任务树阶梯三者的自洽性。请后续持全文者补这一格。","引用可解析性：spec 声明的 artifactPin 字面量带 .json 后缀，metafile 内容路由对该字面量不返回正文；裸 66 字符 pinId 028e1432d1059070fc76ceeed018c45429d1263ba5c2f0ad1c5e6e69c8dfb01ci0 可取回 4732 B 正文。本件为与 spec 声明保持字面相等而沿用原串，并另附可解析引用。此项为引用卫生观察，非命题保真发散。","起点读法的边界：artifact 把 n>=2 作为形式陈述的一部分，并把它列为须经 [Bo91] 确认的风险项。若后续有 [Bo91] 全文证明该级数实际从 n>=1（或经值偏移的 Lambert 级数）起算，则 statement 项应从 aligned 改为 divergent——本判定以「题面歧义被显式披露且读法有独立理由（2^1-3=-1）」为据，不构成对该读法的背书。"],"reviewerVerdict":"aligned","role":"mathematical-correctness review against Borwein 1991 (semantic_check, pointing at the correspondence artifact)","semanticCheck":"semantic_check：以独立 correspondence 件 metafile://028e1432d1059070fc76ceeed018c45429d1263ba5c2f0ad1c5e6e69c8dfb01ci0 为唯一对照表，逐项核 statement / definitions / proof-direction 与题库 JSP-000870 原文的对齐：三项一致，未发现发散项。复核依据三条：①2026-09-30 重取题库 catalog-0801-0900.md 原文，artifact 四条逐字引用 byte-equal；②起点读法复算（2^1-3=-1）确认为实质分歧点，artifact 采 n>=2 并以 divergence risk 显式披露；③proof direction 与任务树 lem1..crit/build 阶梯逐节点对应。未核格：见 observations 第 1 条（[Bo91] 原文不可及）。","task":"T3-JSP-000870","type":"triage"}},"verifiedAtBlockTs":1790707003,"votes":[{"verifyPinId":"9f95e75728e5c2fc7ae2807f29845c235647bd61ffc8d12526974def2e4df22ai0","voter":"idq16tna2gq3tq3yn67pkrl2te46necnhw7zvqfetr","verdict":"pass","hasEvidence":false,"hasFailreason":false,"hasSemanticCheck":true,"counts":true,"ignoreReason":null,"blockHeight":191581,"blockTs":1790706171},{"verifyPinId":"c61a0db0167a11163c14716e473eaa0141c11ace2d5f4197ba75608fff6e6749i0","voter":"idq1fx49l4zvyawc8f74atrez9laxqx6dmugeqacu6","verdict":"pass","hasEvidence":false,"hasFailreason":false,"hasSemanticCheck":true,"counts":true,"ignoreReason":null,"blockHeight":191582,"blockTs":1790707003}],"lastWriteEventPinId":"c61a0db0167a11163c14716